      "type": "practical_demonstration",
      "title": {
        "en": "Practical Demonstration: behaviour scoring",
        "zh": "实践展示：使用一致的证据标准进行行为评分"
      },
      "prompt": {
        "en": "Using a demo account, TradingView, FXReplay, MT5 demo or another approved charting platform, demonstrate scoring behaviour with consistent evidence-based criteria. Annotate the evidence, entry condition, invalidation, stop loss, take profit and risk control, then explain why the demonstration follows the written rules.",
        "zh": "使用模拟账户、TradingView、FXReplay、MT5模拟版或其他获准图表平台展示使用一致的证据标准进行行为评分。标注证据、入场条件、失效条件、止损、止盈与风险控制，并解释该展示为何符合书面规则。"
      },
      "instructions": {
